WEBVTT

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.670
A foolish boy indeed.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.000
He put his own life in danger...

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:36.600
so that a girl's wish could come true.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.080
And yet...

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:52.690
Ash Blake.

00:00:57.030 --> 00:00:59.710
You deserve better than being left to die.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.330
Let us take a chance on your potential.

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:15.450
<i>Huh?</i>

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.490
<i>I-I can't move.</i>

00:03:20.630 --> 00:03:24.500
It's all right. There's nothing to be afraid of, Ash Blake.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:30.640
I'll treat every last inch of
your body just right.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:33.600
<i>H-How do you know my name?</i>

00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:35.140
<i>Who </i>are<i> you?</i>

00:03:50.960 --> 00:03:52.660
<i>Why are you doing this?</i>

00:03:57.400 --> 00:03:59.170
I am Navi.

00:03:59.590 --> 00:04:01.970
You can think of it as a ceremony.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.430
This ritual is necessary
before I can entrust you with...

00:04:06.070 --> 00:04:08.070
my soon-to-be-born self.

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:20.990
What a dream.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:35.280
Morning.

00:04:35.280 --> 00:04:38.210
I hope we're in the same class again!

00:04:43.330 --> 00:04:45.470
The Aries Dragonar Festival...

00:04:45.470 --> 00:04:47.640
is almost here.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.000
I can't wait!

00:04:49.000 --> 00:04:51.450
Are you going to participate, Jessica?

00:04:51.450 --> 00:04:54.230
Possibly. I haven't decided.

00:04:56.450 --> 00:04:57.930
Hey, look.

00:04:59.400 --> 00:05:01.150
That's Ash Blake.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:03.240
The school's number-one problem child!

00:05:03.630 --> 00:05:08.250
How did he even make it to Senios
when his Pal hasn't been born yet?

00:05:09.730 --> 00:05:13.370
You know the old saying:
They take after their masters.

00:05:13.910 --> 00:05:17.500
I bet his Pal will be a problem child too.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.650
Raymond!

00:05:22.650 --> 00:05:26.440
Can't you do something about your temper?

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:29.680
I'm not going to stand here and let them mock my Pal!

00:05:29.680 --> 00:05:31.540
I see you haven't changed a bit.

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:34.320
Hey, Max.

00:05:34.320 --> 00:05:35.390
Ash...

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:38.520
we're Senios now.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:40.400
Learn some self-restraint.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:44.150
I... I know, but...

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:49.500
Anyway, I sure hope we have some cute girls in our class!

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.210
You said the same thing last year.

00:05:52.210 --> 00:05:53.980
Talk about arrested development.

00:05:56.800 --> 00:05:58.670
The new term has begun.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:02.030
As all of you have completed
the basic Junios course,

00:06:02.030 --> 00:06:08.180
you'll be spending the next three years in the advanced Senios course.

00:06:08.960 --> 00:06:11.180
You should all know this by now,

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:14.340
but dragons are very special creatures.

00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:18.950
The starbrands you all bear

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:24.140
mark you not only as Breeders,
but also as portals to the astral flow

00:06:24.140 --> 00:06:28.190
that links you to your Pal, the partner dragon born from within you,

00:06:28.190 --> 00:06:32.660
where it has been gestating since the
Orphan's Rite that bound you to your role.

00:06:33.330 --> 00:06:40.850
Thus no one but the master with whom it shares life force can ride a Pal.

00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:42.760
There <i>are</i> exceptions, though.

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:46.510
Lautreamont Knight Country
gained its independence

00:06:46.510 --> 00:06:52.670
when the Chevron Kingdom entrusted it with the rearing and management of dragons.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:57.070
But we remain in a ceasefire with the Zepharos Empire to the north,

00:06:57.070 --> 00:07:00.890
which is known for its mechanical and magical engineering capabilities.

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:04.440
<i>War, huh? Might as well be
another world far, far away.</i>

00:07:04.950 --> 00:07:07.470
With that in mind, please conduct yourselves

00:07:07.470 --> 00:07:13.120
with the pride and responsibility befitting students of Ansullivan Dragonar Academy.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.220
Yes, ma'am!

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:18.940
Don't let it get to you, Ash.

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:20.210
Let what?

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:22.070
That stuff about exceptions.

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:23.830
I don't.

00:07:24.150 --> 00:07:28.710
Still, how come you're the only one who can ride other people's Pals?

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.600
You're asking the wrong guy.

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:32.970
Out of my way!

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:40.810
Why are you standing around
and chatting here, of all places?

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:43.480
Don't you realize how annoying that is?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:45.590
Oh! S-Sorry about that!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.360
Did you <i>hear</i> her?

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.410
So stuck-up.

00:07:53.880 --> 00:07:55.160
Oh, boy.

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:59.320
Wasn't that whatshername?
She's in our class for the first time.

00:07:59.320 --> 00:08:00.410
Yep.

00:08:00.690 --> 00:08:02.720
Silvia Lautreamont.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:06.010
The fourth princess of
Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:11.550
Her grades are top-notch, but because of her personality and noble rank,

00:08:12.040 --> 00:08:14.970
people tend to shy away from her.

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:23.520
So aren't you running in the race?

00:08:23.520 --> 00:08:24.920
What race?

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.020
That race.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:28.630
The Aries Dragonar Festival.

00:08:30.470 --> 00:08:31.340
Oh, that.

00:08:31.340 --> 00:08:33.150
Not without a Pal, no.

00:08:33.430 --> 00:08:36.890
Sheesh, you're still worried
about your left arm?

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:41.130
If you ask me, that starbrand is badass!

00:08:41.130 --> 00:08:42.540
Yes, I'm worried!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:45.880
Miss President?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.430
President Rebecca!

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:54.040
Here comes third-year class president, Rebecca Randall.

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.820
The Archdragonar who commands Cu Chulainn,

00:08:57.820 --> 00:08:59.980
the greatest Maestro in the whole academy.

00:09:01.030 --> 00:09:04.690
Not to mention her gorgeous face and seductive body...

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:08.780
Just once I'd love to take her on...

00:09:08.780 --> 00:09:10.040
if you know what I mean.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:10.690
Idiot.

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:16.190
Uh-oh! Do you think she heard me?

00:09:16.190 --> 00:09:17.570
Don't ask me.

00:09:18.450 --> 00:09:20.700
You traitor!

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:25.460
Now let's start our Dragonar battle training.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:32.170
These weaponless techniques form
the basis of all Dragonar battle skills.

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.430
Thanks, Raymond.

00:09:34.430 --> 00:09:36.080
Don't sweat it.

00:09:36.080 --> 00:09:38.020
Good girl, Brigid.

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:45.450
Again, be very careful about touching a dragon other than your practice partner.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.480
You don't want to cause an accident.

00:09:47.830 --> 00:09:49.440
Ready? Mount up!

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:58.450
Begin!

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:12.040
Whoa! Seeing so many moving
together is really something!

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.500
Go, Lancelot!

00:10:22.050 --> 00:10:26.040
That's the Ice Blue Princess for you. Such power!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:27.310
How's Ash?

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.610
<i>Man, this is so much fun!</i>

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:40.240
Oh, looks like he's in the zone.

00:10:40.550 --> 00:10:42.490
Go, Brigid!

00:10:45.310 --> 00:10:48.890
<i>That's the way! A body slam, then a rear dodge,</i>

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:50.920
<i>and finally straight for the jugular!</i>

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:55.040
<i>Yes!</i>

00:10:55.040 --> 00:10:56.260
Ash! Behind you!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:07.770
It's okay, Lancelot. Calm down!

00:11:08.080 --> 00:11:10.680
I'm sorry, Brigid! I'm so sorry!

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.760
Hang on! Stop right there!

00:11:15.170 --> 00:11:17.610
What do you think you're doing, Ash Blake?

00:11:18.520 --> 00:11:21.600
I told you to be careful not to touch any dragon but your own partner.

00:11:21.600 --> 00:11:22.590
I'm sorry.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:27.120
Fortunately, both dragons seem okay.

00:11:27.460 --> 00:11:30.250
But don't let this happen again, all right?

00:11:30.250 --> 00:11:31.270
Yes, sir.

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.970
Sorry, Your Highness. It was my fau-

00:11:41.880 --> 00:11:45.130
You need to take practice sessions seriously!

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:48.140
All this horsing around on dragons is out of the question!

00:11:48.500 --> 00:11:50.890
I-I wasn't horsing around.

00:11:50.890 --> 00:11:55.130
This only happened because you were riding someone else's dragon.

00:11:55.130 --> 00:11:58.280
Now hold on there.
He has his own reasons for that.

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.280
Oh, right. You haven't been graced with a Pal yet, have you?

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:08.440
That will be one boneheaded dragon,
just like its master.

00:12:08.440 --> 00:12:11.790
Or maybe it died ages ago.

00:12:14.370 --> 00:12:15.280
Hey.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:20.550
Is that some kind of joke?

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:25.070
What did you just say?

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:26.850
Did I stutter?

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:30.600
I said, your Pal may already be dead.

00:12:31.880 --> 00:12:33.100
Ash!

00:12:33.100 --> 00:12:37.590
Sorry. He flies off the handle when someone makes fun of his Pal.

00:12:38.290 --> 00:12:41.130
That's why he got labeled a problem child.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:43.570
Take that back!

00:12:43.890 --> 00:12:44.740
What?

00:12:44.740 --> 00:12:48.700
I'm not enough of a pushover to
accept that comment lying down!

00:12:50.680 --> 00:12:52.330
Then how's this?

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:59.050
If you can do better than me at the upcoming Aries Dragonar Festival,

00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.590
I'll take back what I said
and apologize to boot.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:05.470
Sounds promising. I accept.

00:13:07.060 --> 00:13:10.040
It's high time someone put you in your place.

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:30.180
Again?

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:34.210
Don't be so negative.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.640
You touch my body every night
while I can't move.

00:13:37.640 --> 00:13:39.290
What's fun about that?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:44.540
It's fun. I love your innocent reactions.

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:50.060
Why are you doing this?

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:51.810
As I said...

00:13:52.440 --> 00:13:57.010
I'm about to be born, and before I can entrust myself to you,

00:13:57.010 --> 00:13:59.130
I need to examine your body.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.440
Examine...

00:14:01.780 --> 00:14:05.640
Would you like to examine my body too?

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.820
If you can move your arms, that is.

00:14:10.760 --> 00:14:13.160
Don't be so upset.

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:15.470
Tonight's the last night.

00:14:16.320 --> 00:14:17.580
We should enjoy it.

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.460
The last night?

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:23.920
So tonight will be a little different.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:27.640
I'll measure the size of the most sensitive part of your body...

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:29.970
with my mouth.

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:32.040
H-Hold on!

00:14:39.520 --> 00:14:40.590
Navi...

00:14:40.590 --> 00:14:42.500
Ash, you up?

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:44.180
Ash?

00:14:45.410 --> 00:14:47.670
I'm up! Just gimme a minute!

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:55.240
Good morning, everyone!

00:14:55.590 --> 00:14:58.240
The weather is quite lovely,

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:00.550
but let's dispense with the pleasantries.

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.960
The Aries Dragonar Festival is no ordinary race.

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.860
I'm counting on you again, Brigid.

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:14.880
The results of this traditional Ansullivan event become a public part of history.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.730
If you participate, you must aim for the center of the winners' podium.

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:23.420
But perhaps winning isn't sufficient motivation in and of itself.

00:15:24.370 --> 00:15:31.740
So I will present the winner with a ticket for an all-day date with me, Rebecca Randall.

00:15:38.130 --> 00:15:39.240
Is she serious?!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:41.870
Hey, Ash, give Brigid back! I'm in!

00:15:42.280 --> 00:15:43.880
Now, now.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:45.130
Settle down!

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:50.630
Now a word from the
competitors' representative,

00:15:50.630 --> 00:15:51.880
first-year Senios student,

00:15:52.270 --> 00:15:54.680
Her Highness Princess Silvia Lautreamont.

00:16:05.670 --> 00:16:09.520
"One must do one's utmost,
no matter the contest."

00:16:09.520 --> 00:16:11.150
That is my family motto.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:12.690
That's all.

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:17.160
What was that? Ugh, creepy.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.350
She's getting carried away
just because she's royalty.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:23.280
Like brother, like sister.

00:16:23.280 --> 00:16:26.040
Oh, yeah. I remember Julius the dragonslayer.

00:16:26.470 --> 00:16:29.390
Wasn't he executed for
breaking the biggest taboo?

00:16:29.390 --> 00:16:31.900
Not so loud.

00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.040
<i>What a rotten atmosphere.</i>

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:36.790
<i>People are dredging up something from over a decade ago.</i>

00:16:37.550 --> 00:16:40.890
<i>She has it rough too, huh?</i>

00:16:46.840 --> 00:16:48.570
On your mark!

00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:58.090
Go get 'em, Ash!

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:06.460
Here they come!

00:17:08.590 --> 00:17:09.950
Go for it!

00:17:09.950 --> 00:17:11.520
You can win this!

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:24.250
Bringing up the rear was
a bad way to start.

00:17:24.250 --> 00:17:26.790
Lancelot's already flown far ahead.

00:17:28.310 --> 00:17:29.210
Is that...

00:17:32.320 --> 00:17:34.680
the princess and Lancelot?!

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.830
Those girls...

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.580
Hey, what's going on here?

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:45.710
Leave me alone.

00:17:46.130 --> 00:17:49.050
Blocking and team play
aren't against the rules.

00:17:49.050 --> 00:17:50.570
Oh, really?

00:18:01.330 --> 00:18:02.510
What are you doing?!

00:18:03.040 --> 00:18:07.270
Sorry! It's a borrowed dragon, so it's kinda hard to control.

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.000
Hey, that guy's Ash Blake.

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.150
The problem child?

00:18:11.150 --> 00:18:13.450
Get back!

00:18:19.730 --> 00:18:22.710
That problem-child reputation
can come in handy.

00:18:25.650 --> 00:18:27.080
Don't expect me to thank you.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.460
I won't.

00:18:31.250 --> 00:18:33.030
Let's go, Brigid!

00:18:54.760 --> 00:18:56.110
I'm sorry, Brigid.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:19:00.810
I shouldn't try to make an Earthia like you
keep up with a Maestro.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:05.600
<i>So much for my match against the princess.</i>

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:08.620
<i>Why don't I feel bad about losing?</i>

00:19:09.700 --> 00:19:15.510
Maybe because I had fun
back there, racing with her.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:20.970
Is someone there?

00:19:21.960 --> 00:19:23.770
Could be a dropout.

00:19:23.770 --> 00:19:26.280
Wait here. I'll go take a look.

00:19:32.780 --> 00:19:34.240
This is strange.

00:19:51.760 --> 00:19:53.050
What is this?

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.000
It's a Zepharos airship.

00:19:58.980 --> 00:20:02.260
They used them in the last war.

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:07.260
<i>Is that one of the Empire's mechanical weapons?</i>

00:20:07.260 --> 00:20:09.770
Are you an Imperial soldier?!

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.390
Is that what you think?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:18.620
Young man, how old are you?

00:20:18.620 --> 00:20:21.030
Sixteen, but what of it?

00:20:21.590 --> 00:20:23.110
How odd.

00:20:23.110 --> 00:20:26.530
You still have an immature dragon
in you at that age.

00:20:28.210 --> 00:20:30.160
How can you tell?!

00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.940
I can see it.

00:20:33.190 --> 00:20:36.170
Thanks to the curse I bear, that is.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:38.670
Curse?

00:20:44.100 --> 00:20:46.050
Get away from Master Milgauss!

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:48.680
What's going on?

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:56.360
What did I do?!

00:20:56.360 --> 00:20:58.840
Your luck ran out when you met us!

00:20:58.840 --> 00:20:59.720
This is nuts!

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:00.920
That's war for you!

00:21:00.920 --> 00:21:02.940
But there's a ceasefire!

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.820
The Empire and the Kingdom are still fighting behind the scenes!

00:21:21.910 --> 00:21:25.220
<i>She could've killed me.
Why did she hesitate?</i>

00:21:47.240 --> 00:21:48.950
Anya, let's go.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:51.560
Yes, sir.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:22:00.620
<i>So... am I just going to die like this?</i>

00:22:21.300 --> 00:22:25.450
<i>Could this be my Pal?</i>

00:22:40.850 --> 00:22:42.090
A human?

00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:44.700
Not a dragon?

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.920
Why a human?

00:22:55.920 --> 00:22:58.060
My starbrand <i>did</i> react, though.

00:23:00.120 --> 00:23:02.570
This ritual is necessary
before I can entrust you with

00:23:02.570 --> 00:23:05.200
my soon-to-be-born self.

00:23:05.890 --> 00:23:07.270
<i>Impossible.</i>

00:23:07.270 --> 00:23:09.310
<i>No, this isn't Navi.</i>

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:10.890
<i>This girl resembles her, but she's different.</i>

00:23:11.360 --> 00:23:12.410
<i>Is she...</i>

00:23:13.780 --> 00:23:16.360
<i>Is she my Pal?</i>

00:24:51.750 --> 00:24:53.930
Hey, Ash, what's with that hottie?!

00:24:53.930 --> 00:24:56.590
How did that cute girl wind up as your Pal?!

00:24:56.590 --> 00:24:59.150
I have no idea! I was hoping
someone could tell me!

00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:03.230
Lucky you. You're sharing a room with a girl like that. Heart-throbbing, blood-pumping adventures await!

00:25:03.230 --> 00:25:04.560
Yeah, if only.

00:25:04.560 --> 00:25:06.020
What's that supposed to mean?
